          "title": "Start a scheduled cloud flow",
          "instruction": "Open **Create**, choose **Scheduled cloud flow**, name it **Daily overdue follow-up summary**, set **Interval** to **1**, **Frequency** to **Day**, enter a valid **Start time**, and select **Create**.",
          "hint": "Use Scheduled cloud flow, not automated or instant. The reminder must run without a user clicking a button.",
          "explanation": "Scheduled cloud flows use a Recurrence trigger; automated flows use connector events, instant flows wait for a manual start, and desktop flows automate local apps with RPA.",
